libwinfsp-x64.a is a GNU delay-import library for winfsp-x64.dll (NiceVault patch).
Its thunks load the DLL on first call through MinGW's __delayLoadHelper2, so an exe
linked against it starts on machines without WinFsp. Regenerate (binutils dlltool):

  llvm-nm ../lib/winfsp-x64.lib | grep -o ' __imp_.*' | sed 's/ __imp_//' | sort -u \
    | { echo 'LIBRARY winfsp-x64.dll'; echo EXPORTS; cat; } > winfsp-x64.def
  x86_64-w64-mingw32-dlltool -d winfsp-x64.def -D winfsp-x64.dll -y libwinfsp-x64.a

Recorded (2026-10-25; scripts/verify-winfsp-gnu-lib.sh checks the structure with llvm-nm):
